Cell["\<\
An explicit rate limit can be specified for delay components. In the \
following example, the absolute ratelimit 7  is obtained by multiplying the \
inbound population P=5 with the specified factor 1.4:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8836cfbf-096d-4bdd-a829-0a73efbab0d4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"dataflow", "[", 
  RowBox[{
